    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">360‑degree digital condition audit:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Capture high‑resolution photos and a video walkthrough of the exterior and interior, noting any scratches, dents, or wear. Timestamp the records and share them with the client to create a transparent baseline for the vehicle transport services process.</p>
