    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">FASTag verification and placement:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Ensure the FASTag is active, correctly affixed to the windshield, and has sufficient balance for tolls. Proper FASTag handling eliminates delays for anyone searching for a car transport service near me and keeps the journey uninterrupted.</p>
